Author: Pragyansh Chaturvedi <pragyansh.chaturvedi@canonical.com>
Last-Update: 2026-02-18
Origin: https://github.com/raspberrypi/libcamera/tree/v0.5.0%2Brpt20250429
Description: Add SyncMode controls and CNN Tensors
 This patch adds the Sync controls and the CNN tensors used on the
 Raspberry Pi 5 from Raspberry Pi's fork of libcamera, specifically
 the commits from the upstream libcamera v0.5.0 tag to the
 v0.5.0+rpt20250429 tag in https://github.com/raspberrypi/libcamera
 (unfortunately this includes merge commits, so production of a
 patch-set is not straight-forward).
 .
 The rpicam-apps and picamera2 packages on Raspberry Pi rely on these
 facilities.

